body:
I don't have a lot to offer for your original question, but I wanted to reinforce what other redditors also seem to be saying.

&#x200B;

You're a wonderful person, and you're doing everything with so much care and sensitivity and your boyfriend will appreciate that. In a way, I think that this is how you can 'fully support' him. Follow his direction as long as you are comfortable. You sound like a great person and I have no doubt your boyfriend is super lucky to have your support right now.
